  "guid": "com.eukyre.pridemags",
  "name": "PrideMags",
  "slug": "pridemags",
  "teaser": "Retextured magazines for inclusivity. Trans rights are human rights <3",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/VvTqXg6extuuWZw7xefbUF6gnqpqkvPAYfqyd4lK.png",
  "downloads": 2038,
  "favourites_count": 6,
  "description": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Overview</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>This mod simply adds a couple of magazines to the game that are painted to represent those in the SPT community who are a part of the LGBTQIA+ community.\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0Z7a90A.gif\" alt=\"Slideshow of all of the mags\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Installation</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ol>\n<li>Download Eukyre-PrideMags.7z</li>\n<li>Open the downloaded .7z file in 7-zip.</li>\n<li>Drag the contents of the .7z file into your base SPT directory.\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/34vXXDj.gif\" alt=\"Install GIF\" /></li>\n</ol></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Showcase</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ClS3zYq.png\" alt=\"Showcase\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-4\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Credits</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Huge thanks to GrooveyPenguinX for creating CommonLib, the database this mod is based upon.</p>\n<p>Check out the WTT Discord server <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://discord.gg/hKRbR6yvf2\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">here.</a></p>\n<p>If you want to, you can support my work on my Ko-Fi page, found <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/mapledesigns\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">here.</a></p></div></div></div>\n",
